  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [autodll-webpack-plugin](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin) from `v0.3.6` to `v0.3.8`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin</summary>\n\n#### 0.3.8\n-   [`55de7b8`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/55de7b8bec9f491d8ef56cc5591bc5dead6eb07f) 0.3.8\n-   [`611b6f2`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/611b6f215163a703a9a91377e813efd718e01e8a) Merge pull request #&#8203;93 from asfktz/fix-createMapper\n-   [`64aed86`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/64aed86b462222c9b7baa74bd4ee2af5a9df8dc8) Fix createMapper with inherit as plain object\n#### 0.3.7\n-   [`42f918c`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/42f918c493c9d75b17b3b3de90820f651d6b7f66) 0.3.7\n-   [`dcf657f`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/dcf657f69c2e473c8ada97b1fda7ba4f968b8b54) format pkg\n-   [`b63d178`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/b63d1786f865a0e01f80f957b72b6077eb3545d3) Merge pull request #&#8203;92 from asfktz/doc-opt-inherit\n-   [`cda780b`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/cda780b72b4745e96d5a0d11938c6b666ecf18bc) Merge pull request #&#8203;91 from WiseBird/master\n-   [`c4d6238`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/c4d6238640b123782b1018c19468e53f49bbefec) Explicitly extract js and css resources for injection.\n-   [`e8642e2`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/e8642e2ac1bdb3787412f4542f7baab103e47f90) Document experimental config option &#x27;inherit&#x27;\n-   [`fb45072`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/fb45072b0ed7eb6a9d49bd45d073fd10fe4459ad) Prevented source maps from being injected into html\n-   [`d2f3ee3`](https://github.com/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/commit/d2f3ee38e5316d12037ca02a85efeeb26069317b) 0.3.6\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](h